        <mxCell id="Mx1gV6xTiy6_RN89OCZ0-8" value="训练监控组件+故障主动检测组件" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=17;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="220" y="-880" width="300" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nstart\n:故障;\n:故障检测与定位;\nif (是否可恢复？) then (是)\n    :故障隔离：移除故障节点;\n    :训练进程重启;\n    :加载检查点断点续训;\n    :恢复训练;\nelse (否)\n    :结束训练;\nendif\nstop\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="Mx1gV6xTiy6_RN89OCZ0-12">
